<title>UK: EDA Finance sets 7.5 billion escudo 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>EDA Finance sets 7.5 billion escudo 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Finantia and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EDA FINANCE LTD</p>
<p> AMT    7.5 BLN ESC   BASE	 6M-LISBOR MATURITY   *01.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +35 BP    PAY DATE    01.APR.97</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES  45 BP     LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> NOTES	*PUT AND CALL OPTIONS AFTER SEVEN YEARS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
